    "cwe_ids": [],
    "description": "### Impact\r\nOn sites where access to Chat is restricted by group, an authenticated user who can\r\nview a read-restricted category but is not allowed to use Chat may receive message\r\ncontent from that category’s chat channel through MessageBus.\r\n\r\nThis is limited to live and recent events available through the MessageBus backlog.\r\nIt does not allow the affected user to retrieve the channel’s full history through\r\nthe Chat API, or to create or modify messages.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nRemove the disallowed user from the category, or avoid using the affected read-restricted category with the user disallowed from chat.",
